{"type":"message","id":"fbe74f22","parentId":"307d0c81","timestamp":"2026-07-28T11:35:04.141Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Friction & Turn-Reduction Report — FEED_DRAIN Run (2026-07-28)\n\n### 1. Turn Count Breakdown\n\n**Total LLM turns:** 11 (including this analysis)\n\n| Turn | Tool Calls | Purpose |\n|------|------------|---------|\n| 1 | `exec` | Claim feed job |\n| 2 | `exec` | `init_run.sh` + source env |\n| 3 | `exec` | Persist batch config |\n| 4 | `exec` | Build picker input |\n| 5 | `sessions_spawn` + `sessions_yield` | Picker subagent |\n| 6 | `exec` | Validate picks + Step 2.0 setup |\n| 7 | `sessions_spawn` + `sessions_yield` | Researcher subagent |\n| 8 | `exec` (x3) | Validate research + topic check + register topic |\n| 9 | `exec` | pre_write gate + manifest update |\n| 10 | `sessions_spawn` + `sessions_yield` | Writer subagent |\n| 11 | `exec` (x5) | Sync article + autofix + check + post_sync + build creator input |\n| 12 | `sessions_spawn` + `sessions_yield` | Creator subagent |\n| 13 | `exec` (x7) | Image verify + Drive upload chain |\n| 14 | `exec` (x3) | WordPress + token aggregation + manifest |\n| 15 | `exec` (x4) | Card + update pick + archive + mark job |\n| 16 | `exec` (x2) | Cleanup + dispatcher |\n| 17+ | Duplicate creator announcements (ignored) |\n| N | `exec` + analysis | This report |\n\n---\n\n### 2. Compound Execution Opportunities\n\n**Major chaining opportunities:**\n\n| Current Turns | Commands (separate) | Combined | Turns Saved |\n|---------------|---------------------|----------|-------------|\n| 3 turns (8–10) | validate_research + topic_duplicate + update_recent_topics + verify_artifacts pre_write + manifest | All in one bash | **3 → 1** (save 2) |\n| 2 turns (13 partial) | sync_article + autofix + check_article + post_sync + build_creator_input | All in one bash | **2 → 1** (save 1) |\n| 2 turns (14) | verify_artifacts pre_drive + Drive prefix/parent resolution + upload + persist | Chain with `&&` | **2 → 1** (save 1) |\n| 3 turns (15) | verify_artifacts pre_wp + publish.sh + update_recent_topics + aggregate_tokens + manifest + build_and_send_card + update_pick + archive | All in one bash | **3 → 1** (save 2) |\n\n**Total compoundable turns:** 10 → 4 blocks = **6 turns saved**\n\n---\n\n### 3. Subagent Handoff & Retry Friction\n\n| Subagent | Failed? | Retry? | Cause |\n|----------|---------|--------|-------|\n| Picker | ❌ No | ❌ No | Completed first time |\n| Researcher | ❌ No | ❌ No | Completed first time, passed validation |\n| Writer | ❌ No | ❌ No | 1038 words, ARTICLE_CHECK: PASS on first attempt |\n| Creator | ❌ No | ❌ No | Image generated, file verified (236KB) |\n\n**Zero retries.** The creator sent duplicate completion announcements at turns 17–18, but these were ignored since the artifact was already verified and the pipeline had moved past Step 2.3.\n\n---\n\n### 4. File Path & Variable Resolution Errors\n\n| Error | Turn | Root Cause | Resolution |\n|-------|------|------------|------------|\n| `DRIVE_JSON_ERROR: no webViewLink found` | 13 | `save_google_drive_json.py` expected top-level `webViewLink` but gog returns nested `file.webViewLink` | Manual Python inline extraction (valid, no turn lost) |\n| Variable `$DRIVE_JSON` empty in second `exec` | 13 | Shell variable not exported; each `exec` is isolated | Passed inline JSON string to Python script |\n\n**No file-not-found failures.** All `$RUN_DIR` paths were correctly expanded before spawning subagents.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Top 3 Turn-Reduction Recommendations\n\n#### Recommendation 1: Create `run_post_research.sh` compound script\n\nCombine all post-research validation steps into one atomic script:\n\n```bash\n# skills/pipeline/run_post_research.sh\n# Input: PICK_INDEX, PIPELINE_MANIFEST\n# Runs: validate_research + topic_duplicate + register_topic + pre_write_gate + manifest_update\n# Output: succeeds or exits 1 with error\n```\n\n**Saves 2 turns** (current: validate → topic → register → gate → manifest = 3 exec turns → 1)\n\n---\n\n#### Recommendation 2: Create `run_post_write.sh` compound script\n\nCombine article sync, autofix, check, and creator input build:\n\n```bash\n# skills/pipeline/run_post_write.sh\n# Input: PIPELINE_MANIFEST, PICK_INDEX\n# Runs: pre_sync + sync_article + autofix + check_article + post_sync + build_creator_input\n# Output: APPROVED (with creator fields) or ARTICLES_FAIL\n```\n\n**Saves 1–2 turns** (current: sync → autofix/check → post_sync + creator_input = 2–3 turns → 1)\n\n---\n\n#### Recommendation 3: Create `run_wp_publish_chain.sh` compound script\n\nPre-WP gate → publish → update topics → aggregate tokens → manifest → card → update pick → archive:\n\n```bash\n# skills/pipeline/run_wp_publish_chain.sh --manifest $MANIFEST --pick-id $ID --project $SLUG\n```\n\n**Saves 2–3 turns** (current: 3–4 exec turns → 1)\n\n---\n\n### Summary\n\n- **Current turns:** ~11 (excluding duplicates + analysis)\n- **Achievable with compounds:** ~5–6 turns\n- **Zero subagent retries** this run — validation all passed first try\n- **One minor Drive JSON format mismatch** (handled inline, no turn lost)\n- **Top opportunity:** Batch all deterministic shell steps (gates, validations, artifact moves) into compound scripts while keeping subagent spawns as the only turn boundaries"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bedrock-mantle","model":"zai.glm-5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1785238489885,"responseId":"chatcmpl-4005efc0-2535-4c48-92a0-df920da0c25e"}}
